# Zustand access

Follow `.agents/skills/zustand/SKILL.md`.

- Rendered value → `useAppStore((state) => state.count)`
- Handler / non-UI read → `useAppStore.getState().count` (or `.increment()`)
- Never call `useAppStore(...)` inside nested non-hook functions
- Never use `getState()` as a substitute when the UI must update
